{
  "episode": "ep04",
  "title": "武士誕生!源平合戦と鎌倉幕府",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 511.739,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 3.147,
          "text": "ねえ先生、武士は最初から強かったの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 3.447,
          "duration": 5.483,
          "text": "実は、長い下積みから天下を取ったんです!源平の合戦から、順番に見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 9.229,
          "duration": 2.496,
          "text": "よし、源平からスタートなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 12.525,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 12.525,
          "duration": 2.827,
          "text": "武士って、平安でも登場したのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 15.652,
          "duration": 3.253,
          "text": "ええ、平安の終わりに武力を持ち始めた武士。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 19.205,
          "duration": 2.795,
          "text": "ついに、皇室と貴族の争いに召し出されます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 22.3,
          "duration": 4.096,
          "text": "1156年の保元の乱、翌年の平治の乱。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 26.696,
          "duration": 6.539,
          "text": "ここで源義朝と平清盛たちが、武力で政治に介入しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 33.535,
          "duration": 2.944,
          "text": "「戦えば政治が変わる」ってことなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 36.779,
          "duration": 0.725,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 37.804,
          "duration": 4.245,
          "text": "これからは、刀を持つ者が時代を動かす、武力社会のはじまりです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 42.649,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 42.649,
          "duration": 2.699,
          "text": "平治の乱に勝ったのは、どっちなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 45.648,
          "duration": 2.315,
          "text": "なぜなら平治の乱で源氏が負けたからです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 48.263,
          "duration": 2.123,
          "text": "その結果、平氏が台頭します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 50.685,
          "duration": 2.624,
          "text": "負けた側が、次に強くなるなのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 53.609,
          "duration": 3.605,
          "text": "太政大臣って、貴族のナンバーワンの官なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 57.515,
          "duration": 0.491,
          "text": "ええ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 58.305,
          "duration": 0.491,
          "text": "しかも宋との貿易で財力を蓄え、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 59.096,
          "duration": 3.019,
          "text": "瀬戸内海を独占して武士初の政権を作りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 62.415,
          "duration": 2.539,
          "text": "武力とお金、最強コンボなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 65.553,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 65.553,
          "duration": 2.507,
          "text": "でも、源氏は復活できるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 68.36,
          "duration": 6.347,
          "text": "1180年、以仁王の令旨を頼りに、源頼朝が挙兵します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 75.007,
          "duration": 5.333,
          "text": "関東の武士たちが続々と集まり、鎌倉を拠点にしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 80.64,
          "duration": 2.4,
          "text": "頼朝なのだ!まけず嫌いなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 83.34,
          "duration": 4.672,
          "text": "ええ。そして弟の義経が、武将として大活躍します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 88.312,
          "duration": 2.229,
          "text": "兄弟タッグ、最強なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 91.141,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 91.141,
          "duration": 1.909,
          "text": "平氏は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 93.351,
          "duration": 6.411,
          "text": "1185年、下関の壇ノ浦の海戦で、義経が平氏を滅ぼしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 100.061,
          "duration": 3.488,
          "text": "約20年ぶりに、源氏が天下を取り返します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 103.849,
          "duration": 3.029,
          "text": "海の大決戦なのだ!船で戦うのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 107.179,
          "duration": 3.104,
          "text": "ええ、潮の流れまで読んだ名勝負と伝わります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 110.583,
          "duration": 2.453,
          "text": "これで武士の天下は、源氏に決まりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 113.336,
          "duration": 2.197,
          "text": "義経、海でも強いのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 116.133,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 116.133,
          "duration": 2.507,
          "text": "じゃ、ついに鎌倉幕府なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 118.94,
          "duration": 5.056,
          "text": "1185年、頼朝は全国に守護と地頭を置きます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 124.296,
          "duration": 7.104,
          "text": "治安を守る守護、荘園や国の領地を管理して年貢を集める地頭です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 131.7,
          "duration": 2.976,
          "text": "日本中に、武士のネットワークなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 134.976,
          "duration": 2.464,
          "text": "その網を元に、1192年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 137.74,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "頼朝は征夷大将軍に就任して、鎌倉幕府が成立します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 142.051,
          "duration": 3.968,
          "text": "守護・地頭を置いた1185年が幕府成立という説も、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b07.wav",
          "start": 146.319,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "新教科書には載っていますよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b08.wav",
          "start": 148.389,
          "duration": 4.075,
          "text": "「1192年、鎌倉幕府」丸暗記なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 153.064,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 153.064,
          "duration": 2.592,
          "text": "幕府の中身って、どうなってるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 155.956,
          "duration": 3.605,
          "text": "将軍と御家人の、御恩と奉公の関係です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 159.861,
          "duration": 6.784,
          "text": "将軍は領地を守る御恩を与え、御家人は戦で奉公する約束です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 166.945,
          "duration": 2.144,
          "text": "御恩って、お小遣いなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 169.389,
          "duration": 3.307,
          "text": "いいえ、領地をもらえるから生活の助けになるんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 172.996,
          "duration": 2.112,
          "text": "大切なのは主従の約束ですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 175.408,
          "duration": 3.552,
          "text": "「あなたにお恩、私が働く」契約なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b07.wav",
          "start": 179.26,
          "duration": 3.808,
          "text": "ええ、主従が実利で結ばれる、武士らしい関係です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b08.wav",
          "start": 183.368,
          "duration": 2.325,
          "text": "この仕組みが、幕府の土台になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b09.wav",
          "start": 185.993,
          "duration": 3.253,
          "text": "恩をあげて、奉公をもらう、ウィンウィンなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 189.847,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 189.847,
          "duration": 2.965,
          "text": "天皇は、この間、何をしてたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 193.112,
          "duration": 5.109,
          "text": "力を取り戻したい後鳥羽上皇が、幕府討伐の兵を挙げます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 198.521,
          "duration": 2.72,
          "text": "1221年の承久の乱です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 201.541,
          "duration": 2.891,
          "text": "天皇vs幕府、大勝負なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 204.732,
          "duration": 3.307,
          "text": "ええ、でも御家人たちは頼朝の恩を覚えていて、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 208.339,
          "duration": 1.579,
          "text": "幕府側が圧勝しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 210.217,
          "duration": 2.304,
          "text": "前の時代は朝廷が中心だったけれど、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 212.821,
          "duration": 2.891,
          "text": "その結果、この後は幕府が天下を動かします。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 216.012,
          "duration": 2.048,
          "text": "時代の主役が入れかわるなのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b09.wav",
          "start": 218.36,
          "duration": 3.083,
          "text": "天皇でも勝てないのだ…時代が変わったなのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 222.043,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 222.043,
          "duration": 2.72,
          "text": "頼朝の後は、だれがリーダーなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 225.063,
          "duration": 2.923,
          "text": "頼朝の妻の実家、北条氏です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 228.285,
          "duration": 4.992,
          "text": "執権という役が政治を動かす、執権政治が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 233.577,
          "duration": 2.251,
          "text": "北条さん、じわじわ来たのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 236.128,
          "duration": 6.816,
          "text": "3代執権の北条泰時は、1232年に御成敗式目を作ります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 243.244,
          "duration": 3.84,
          "text": "武士のルールを書いた、日本初の武家法です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 247.384,
          "duration": 2.677,
          "text": "ルールブックで政治、堅実なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 250.661,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 250.661,
          "duration": 2.613,
          "text": "でも、敵は中国だけじゃないのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 253.575,
          "duration": 2.485,
          "text": "モンゴル帝国が日本に来ます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 256.36,
          "duration": 7.36,
          "text": "1274年の文永の役、1281年の弘安の役、二度の大襲来です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 264.02,
          "duration": 2.869,
          "text": "台風で敵が負けた…って話なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 267.189,
          "duration": 2.453,
          "text": "ええ、神風と呼ばれます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 269.943,
          "duration": 5.237,
          "text": "守護・地頭の名の下に、全国の武士が日本を守りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 275.48,
          "duration": 2.955,
          "text": "蒙古襲来絵詞って、この絵なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 278.735,
          "duration": 0.64,
          "text": "そうです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b08.wav",
          "start": 279.675,
          "duration": 2.859,
          "text": "でも、戦った御家人には恩賞が届きにくく、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b09.wav",
          "start": 282.833,
          "duration": 1.856,
          "text": "幕府への不満がたまっていきます。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 285.289,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 285.289,
          "duration": 2.816,
          "text": "幕府の中で、不満はどうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 288.405,
          "duration": 2.389,
          "text": "争いを収めるため、北条氏の当主、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 291.095,
          "duration": 2.752,
          "text": "得宗がすべてを握る得宗専制へ進みます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 294.147,
          "duration": 2.528,
          "text": "ますます、かたくなな政治なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 296.975,
          "duration": 4.565,
          "text": "ええ、御家人との絆が薄れ、幕府は少しずつ弱体化していきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 301.84,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "中央の御家人は恩賞をめぐる争いが絶えず、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 304.871,
          "duration": 2.037,
          "text": "地方の武士の力も増していきました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b07.wav",
          "start": 307.208,
          "duration": 2.656,
          "text": "このすきまが、次の話の種なのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 310.464,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 310.464,
          "duration": 2.848,
          "text": "戦の世で、心の支えはなんなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 313.612,
          "duration": 2.699,
          "text": "ええ、今までの仏教は貴族のもの。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 316.611,
          "duration": 3.179,
          "text": "ここで、庶民の救いを説く鎌倉仏教が広がります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 320.089,
          "duration": 3.104,
          "text": "法然は浄土宗で「一向に念佛せよ」。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 323.493,
          "duration": 5.963,
          "text": "親鸞は浄土真宗で、「悪人正機」つまり誰でも救われると説きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 329.756,
          "duration": 3.403,
          "text": "一向に念佛…「ただ念じればいい」なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 333.459,
          "duration": 4.619,
          "text": "ええ、身分や学問に関係なく救われる、庶民にぴったりの教えです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 338.677,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 338.677,
          "duration": 1.675,
          "text": "ほかの宗派もあるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 340.652,
          "duration": 1.291,
          "text": "日蓮は法華宗で、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 342.243,
          "duration": 3.552,
          "text": "「南無妙法蓮華経」の題目を唱える教えを広めました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 346.095,
          "duration": 0.661,
          "text": "そして禅。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 347.056,
          "duration": 1.184,
          "text": "栄西が臨済宗、道元が曹洞宗を開き、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 348.54,
          "duration": 2.997,
          "text": "座って心を静める修養が武士に大流行します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 351.837,
          "duration": 2.176,
          "text": "座禅なのだ!武士っぽいのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b07.wav",
          "start": 354.313,
          "duration": 2.517,
          "text": "ええ、心を鍛える教えだからでしょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b08.wav",
          "start": 357.131,
          "duration": 2.88,
          "text": "宗教が庶民と武士の心の柱になった時代です。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 360.811,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 360.811,
          "duration": 3.861,
          "text": "ここから受験ポイントのまとめ!まずは、武士の政権までの流れ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 364.972,
          "duration": 4.0,
          "text": "保元・平治の乱で武士が台頭、平氏政権と宋貿易、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 369.272,
          "duration": 12.853,
          "text": "1180年頼朝挙兵、1185年壇ノ浦、1192年鎌倉幕府成立。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 382.425,
          "duration": 1.44,
          "text": "守護と地頭も忘れずに!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 384.165,
          "duration": 3.701,
          "text": "「御恩と奉公」の主従関係も、必ず押さえてください。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 388.467,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 388.467,
          "duration": 2.432,
          "text": "後半は、幕府の運営と宗教です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 391.199,
          "duration": 5.195,
          "text": "承久の乱1221年、北条泰時の御成敗式目1232年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 396.693,
          "duration": 10.944,
          "text": "元寇は文永1274・弘安1281。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 407.937,
          "duration": 2.421,
          "text": "その後は得宗専制で幕府は弱体化。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 410.659,
          "duration": 5.632,
          "text": "鎌倉仏教は、法然・親鸞・日蓮・禅(栄西・道元)。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b05.wav",
          "start": 416.591,
          "duration": 3.019,
          "text": "庶民の宗教、とセットです!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 420.409,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 420.409,
          "duration": 2.091,
          "text": "それではクイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 422.8,
          "duration": 9.653,
          "text": "1185年、源義経が平氏を滅ぼした海戦は何でしょう?ア、壇ノ浦。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 432.753,
          "duration": 1.685,
          "text": "イ、長篠。ウ、関ケ原。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 434.739,
          "duration": 1.931,
          "text": "海の決戦…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 436.969,
          "duration": 4.555,
          "text": "正解!壇ノ浦です。1185年とセットでしっかりおぼえましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 442.124,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 442.124,
          "duration": 0.661,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 443.085,
          "duration": 9.003,
          "text": "将軍が御恩を与え、御家人が奉公をする、武士の主従関係を何という?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 452.388,
          "duration": 3.84,
          "text": "ア、御成敗式目。イ、御恩と奉公。ウ、得宗専制。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 456.528,
          "duration": 2.315,
          "text": "恩と働きのペア…イなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 459.143,
          "duration": 1.888,
          "text": "正解!御恩と奉公です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 461.331,
          "duration": 2.805,
          "text": "幕府の土台になった、大事なキーワードですよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 464.736,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 464.736,
          "duration": 0.843,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 465.879,
          "duration": 9.867,
          "text": "1232年、北条泰時が定めた武家のルールブックは?ア、大宝律令。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 476.045,
          "duration": 1.984,
          "text": "イ、十七条憲法。ウ、御成敗式目。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 478.329,
          "duration": 2.197,
          "text": "武家のルールブック…ウなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 480.827,
          "duration": 2.037,
          "text": "正解!御成敗式目です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b05.wav",
          "start": 483.164,
          "duration": 3.712,
          "text": "大宝律令701年との年号ペアも、覚えておきましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 487.676,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 487.676,
          "duration": 4.341,
          "text": "今日は武士の登場から鎌倉幕府の盛衰まで、激動の時代を見ました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 492.317,
          "duration": 5.173,
          "text": "壇ノ浦、御恩と奉公、承久の乱、元寇、鎌倉仏教…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 497.791,
          "duration": 2.571,
          "text": "年号と人名、いっぱいなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 500.661,
          "duration": 3.787,
          "text": "次回第5話は、足利尊氏と南北朝、そして戦国へ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 504.748,
          "duration": 1.995,
          "text": "鎌倉のゆらぎが大きく咲きますよ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b05.wav",
          "start": 507.043,
          "duration": 4.096,
          "text": "つぎは合戦づくし!?チャンネル登録も、よろしくなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sections": {
